"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduceable in 4.5 beta5\n- Not reproducable in 4.4.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7700) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.94 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n**EDIT: on further investigation, I found out that it only happens when `interface/editor/single_window_mode` is `true` (Editor set to single window mode)**\nWhen hovering in the script editor above e.g. a function call, you will get the new hint popup.\nWhile the hint popup is shown, mouse wheel scrolling is not working anymore in the script.\nThis is a major usability impediment as scrolling to a position where the mouse cursor randomly hovers a function call suddenly disables scrolling.\n\nI noticed this is **very annoying** and slowing down my development time.\n\nIn the following video I am trying to scroll through a script.\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d420004d-08d0-468c-b156-9399a03efb0b\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nopen a script (ideally a longer one), scroll through the script slowly - randomly land on a function call with the mouse cursor while scrolling.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nnot neccessary, happens in any script when single window mode is enabled.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109487/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109487/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}